{"id":3946,"date":"2017-08-09T09:10:45","date_gmt":"2017-08-09T13:10:45","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=3946"},"modified":"2017-08-09T09:10:45","modified_gmt":"2017-08-09T13:10:45","slug":"part-2-nwest-michigan-road-trip-mushrooms-tunnels-bears-and-indians-oh-my","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/08\/09\/part-2-nwest-michigan-road-trip-mushrooms-tunnels-bears-and-indians-oh-my\/","title":{"rendered":"Part 2 &#8211; N&#8217;West Michigan Road Trip &#8211; Mushrooms, Tunnels, Bears, and Indians &#8211; Oh My!"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>We left Charlevoix the next morning after a comfortable stay at the Maple Leaf Inn and continued north on M-31 toward Petoskey. \u00a0We had an opportunity to go along Lake Charlevoix on our way to Urgent Care (that&#8217;s another story altogether) when we happened along some of the famous &#8220;<a href=\"http:\/\/www.visitcharlevoix.com\/Earl-Young\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Mushroom Houses<\/a>&#8221; we had heard about. \u00a0You can read more about these famous homes and the self-taught architect that designed and built these beautiful homes by <a href=\"http:\/\/www.visitcharlevoix.com\/Earl-Young\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">clicking here<\/a>.<\/p>\n<div id='gallery-1' class='gallery galleryid-3946 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-full'><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/2017-07-21-08.19.24.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/2017-07-21-08.19.24.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/2017-07-21-08.19.24.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/2017-07-21-08.19.24-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/2017-07-21-08.19.24-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/2017-07-21-08.19.24-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/2017-07-21-08.19.13.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/2017-07-21-08.19.13.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/2017-07-21-08.19.13.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/2017-07-21-08.19.13-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/2017-07-21-08.19.13-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/2017-07-21-08.19.13-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/2017-07-21-08.18.56.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/2017-07-21-08.18.56.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/2017-07-21-08.18.56.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/2017-07-21-08.18.56-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/2017-07-21-08.18.56-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/2017-07-21-08.18.56-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/2017-07-21-07.27.11.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/2017-07-21-07.27.11.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/2017-07-21-07.27.11.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/2017-07-21-07.27.11-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/2017-07-21-07.27.11-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/2017-07-21-07.27.11-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p>Heading out of Charlevoix on M-31 along the south edge of Little Traverse Bay, we arrived in Petoskey (famous for <a href=\"https:\/\/en.wikipedia.org\/wiki\/Petoskey_stone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Petoskey Stones<\/a>) and we happened across their Farmer&#8217;s Market. \u00a0Since we don&#8217;t have a lot of room for storage, nor do we have a large refrigerator, the only thing Kathy bought was a bar of hand made soap. Here&#8217;s a few pictures from the market, everything was so colorful and attractive!<\/p>\n<div id='gallery-2' class='gallery galleryid-3946 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-full'><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.28.35.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.28.35.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.28.35.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.28.35-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.28.35-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.28.35-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.22.44.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.22.44.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.22.44.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.22.44-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.22.44-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.22.44-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.21.37.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.21.37.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.21.37.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.21.37-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.21.37-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.21.37-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.18.22.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.18.22.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.18.22.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.18.22-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.18.22-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.18.22-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.18.19.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.18.19.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.18.19.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.18.19-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.18.19-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.18.19-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.18.15.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.18.15.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.18.15.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.18.15-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.18.15-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-09.18.15-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p>Moving on up the road out of Petoskey, some friends of ours here at the park told us about State Route 119 and the &#8220;<a href=\"http:\/\/mynorth.com\/2016\/05\/m-119s-tunnel-of-trees\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Tunnel of Trees<\/a>&#8220;. \u00a0It sounded fascinating and we wanted to stay along the lake shore, so off we went due north on SR 119. \u00a0Video below.<\/p>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/V-d14Bk2xcY\" width=\"600\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"><\/iframe><\/p>\n<p>The Tunnel of Trees starts at about Harbor Springs and ends at a small hamlet called <a href=\"http:\/\/www.michigan.org\/city\/cross-village#?c=44.4299:-85.1166:7&amp;tid=407&amp;page=0&amp;pagesize=20&amp;pagetitle=Cross%20Village\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cross Village<\/a> where we found the famous (and out of the way) &#8220;Legs Inn&#8221; restaurant. \u00a0Unfortunately for us, the restaurant doesn&#8217;t open until noon and we got there just a little too early, but we did take the opportunity to walk the grounds and check out some of the history of the place. \u00a0There are beautiful gardens out back with patio seating and the original designer, Stanley Smolak had an eclectic flair and utilized the local Odawa Indians to help him build the Legs Inn. \u00a0<a href=\"http:\/\/www.legsinn.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">See more about the Legs Inn at this link.<\/a><\/p>\n<div id='gallery-3' class='gallery galleryid-3946 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-full'><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-11.37.07.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-11.37.07.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-11.37.07.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-11.37.07-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-11.37.07-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-11.37.07-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-11.36.49.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-11.36.49.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-3-3969\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-11.36.49.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-11.36.49-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-11.36.49-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-11.36.49-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-3-3969'>\n\t\t\t\tThe Village Bear\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.