c=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-11.26.13.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-3-3980\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-11.26.13.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-11.26.13-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-11.26.13-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-11.26.13-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-3-3980'>\n\t\t\t\tThe Legs Inn &#8211; Designed by Stanley Smolak and built by local Odawa Indians\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-11.27.10.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"304\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-07-21-11.27.10.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-3-3997\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-3-3997'>\n\t\t\t\tAll about the Legs Inn and it&#8217;s designer\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p>Beyond Cross Village (on M-119) we worked our way east and north on up to The <a href=\"http:\/\/www.midarkskypark.org\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Headlands International Dark Sky Park<\/a>, <a href=\"http:\/\/www.mcgulpinpoint.org\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">McGulpin Point Lighthouse<\/a>, stopped for ice cream in Mackinaw City and then on over the bridge. \u00a0Although the day was clear and sunny in the city, the fog was heavy at the bridge and visibility was poor if not non-existent.<\/p>\n<div id='gallery-4' cl